e ח לְבאֹ ׳(עַדֿ) = the entrance to H. , i.e. the approach to H. , as territorial limit Judg 3:3 ; usually as denoting (ideal) northern limit of Israel territory Josh 13:5 ; Num 13:21 ; 34:8 ; Amos 6:14 ; 1Kin 8:65 2Chr 7:8 ; 2Kin 14:25 ; 1Chr 13:5 ; חֲמָ֑תָה 18:3 ; ׳ח צובָה 2Chr 8:3 , and וְאֶתחֿ ׳אֶתדַּֿמֶּשֶׂק לִיחוּדָה הֵשִׁיב 2Kin 14:28 ; so also Ezekiel 47:48: ח ׳גְּבוּל Ezek 47:17 , compare V:16 b + V:16 a (strike out Co); ח ׳לְבוֺא 48:1 , compare 47:20 ; ח ׳אֶליַֿד 48:1 .","rootNote":"from the same as 2346 ; walled ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 13 5","keyReferences":["1Chr 13 5","1Chr 18 3","1Chr 18 9","1Kgs 8 65","2Chr 7 8","2Chr 8 4","2Kgs 14 25","2Kgs 14 28"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":35,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 13 5","book":"1Chr","chapter":13,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָ֑ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 3","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָ֑תָ/ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp/Sd"},{"reference":"1Chr 18 9","book":"1Chr","chapter":18,"verse":9,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָ֑ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Kgs 8 65","book":"1Kgs","chapter":8,"verse":65,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָ֣ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 7 8","book":"2Chr","chapter":7,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Chr 8 4","book":"2Chr","chapter":8,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַּ/חֲמָֽת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Np"},{"reference":"2Kgs 14 25","book":"2Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָ֖ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Kgs 14 28","book":"2Kgs","chapter":14,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"חֲמָ֛ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"2Kgs 17 24","book":"2Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":24